{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mature visual novel set in an original future sci-fi universe. The game is heavy on story &amp; characterization. It is interspersed with rich &amp; tasteful animated cutscenes to bring the world, it\u2019s characters, vehicles, &amp; scenarios to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a good mix of humor, drama, &amp; discovery through a story with dialogue choices that let you mold eventual outcomes and pursue interesting story variants. Pursue friendship &amp; romance with characters of various ages, cultures, &amp; realities..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/649e39d091070534d159399f079b9bb9.poster.avif?t=1764409628\" width=999 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/649e39d091070534d159399f079b9bb9.webm?t=1764409628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth, it\u2019s colonies, &amp; allies are under threat, &amp; it might lose its freedom &amp; potentially its survival to a former allied alien nation. Grand conquests, conspiracies &amp; secret alliances threaten your comrades, &amp; free peoples out among the stars.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/70610664b7cc7c015e8ca3dbb15f9be1.poster.avif?t=1764409628\" width=999 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/70610664b7cc7c015e8ca3dbb15f9be1.webm?t=1764409628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aether HeXXen are \u201cSpace Witches\u201d who use interesting tech from a long-dead galaxy-spanning race &amp; interstellar pilot skills to ambush forces of an evil star empire in the 29th century. You are a very special recruit who can use the machines and networks to save humanity &amp; those friendly aliens from slavery or extinction.\u00a0 Your initial plan was to be a planetary space bus driver, but with the fate of humanity in the balance you need to step up &amp; be a hero for the sake of your growing group of friends &amp; unexpected admirers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/4b577e90e8cd6cea5f2f36cb6d25b5d8.poster.avif?t=1764409628\" width=999 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/extras/4b577e90e8cd6cea5f2f36cb6d25b5d8.webm?t=1764409628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story set in a many original future worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military &amp; Exploration Scif-Fi with Ancient Alien, Artifact Hunt, Archeology&amp; Other Earthy Space Adventure motifs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes Days 0 through 3 with plans for several weeks more of content.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your friend &amp; closer friend network with diverse characters with interesting motivations &amp; personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1660 individual 3D renders. Plans to 4X This number by end of Act1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 tasteful romantic encounters with tasteful comedic or heartfelt style.\u00a0 Plans to 10X this number by the end of Act1 and release more visually acceptably close versions at the time of full release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 animated video scenes.\u00a0 Plans to 10X This number by end of Act1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans for Lore&amp; Character Profile Sections with Chapter Based Sandbox Navigation Options&amp; Inventory Section Interaction.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033750?t=1764409628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033750?t=1764409628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/d70598126df91bed5060a00023347e0812330e2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764409628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033750/d70598126df91bed5060a00023347e0812330e2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764409628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"No visually simulated intimacy. Described activities consensual and completely participatory.  There is no depiction or genitals or penetration and only textually  implied contact.  The acts are secondary to the interaction around them and only show positive connection related to greater relationship value.  No visually explicit scenes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mature visual novel set in an original future sci-fi universe. The game is heavy on story &amp; characterization. It is interspersed with rich &amp; tasteful animated cutscenes to bring the world, it\u2019s characters, vehicles, &amp; scenarios to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph